Records and checks offline backend bundles; does not verify a live server

Usage: leptoskit verify <COMMAND>

Commands:
  record  Records the files in a prepared backend bundle. This does not build, sign, or attest the bundle
  check   Checks every bundle entry against an inventory with a separately trusted SHA-256. Does not contact or verify a running server
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
